      "widgets_values": [
        "The prompt is a general task prompt for enhancing quality but you can give other instructions. Edit instructions work as well, so you can ask normally for editing the input while the sampler takes care of the refining and upscaling.\n\nWorth knowing: this kind of model regenerates rather than preserves, so name any distinctive detail you want kept (for example \"the person has their eyes closed\"). Anything the prompt does not mention is open to reinterpretation."
